      },
      "message": "fix: npm test script for Node >= 20.14 / 22 / 24 — drop the directory positional\n\n'node --test test/' throws MODULE_NOT_FOUND on modern Node (the bare\ndirectory positional after --test is no longer resolved as a scan dir /\nspawned as a test runner since the test-runner glob/positional rework,\nbreaking on Node v24). Bare 'node --test' auto-discovers test/*.test.js\nand is the supported form.\n\nLocal receipt (Node v24.21.0): before fix 'npm test' exit 1 (Cannot find\nmodule '.../coev/test'); after fix exit 0, tests 33 / pass 33 / fail 0.\nCI (tools/run-tests.js) already used the robust explicit-file form.",
