      "message": "coev v0.1.0 — adversarial coevolution engine + champion-integrity auditor\n\nExtracted from SuperInstance/pong-quilt core.js @ b4d15c8 (C1 engine);\nring/evaluator lineage via quilt-edge-ml. The auditor encodes the\nR53/R54 save: a champion claiming 1259.1 that benched 239.6 (hollow).\n\n- src/: rng (seeded LCG), ring (honest-eviction FIFO), evaluator\n  (streaming top-K + onTie seam), ledger (hash-chained, tamper-evident,\n  verifyLedger), engine (loser-mutates-harder; runTournament), audit\n  (auditClaim/benchmarkChamp/championReport; CONFIRMED/REFUTED/SIMULATED/MEASURED)\n- arenas/pong.js: reference arena, full C1 port (escalation laws intact)\n- bin/coev.js: run/audit/demo CLI; usage errors exit 2; audit REFUSED exits 1;\n  result.json unwraps announced on stderr; arena validate hook\n- docs/: ARENA.md (write-your-own-arena), INTEGRITY.md (the R53/R54 essay)\n- 33 pins green (node tools/run-tests.js)",
